    <h3>How long does a sweepstakes casino redemption take?</h3>
    <p>There is no verified, comparable end-to-end range across this index. Check each operator record for published timing and its scope: verification, processing or delivery. These are published claims, not measured results.</p>
    <h3>Why is my first redemption slower?</h3>
    <p>A first redemption can require identity and payment-method checks before approval. Later requests can also require checks; an already verified account is not a guarantee of faster delivery.</p>
    <h3>What is the minimum redemption at each operator?</h3>
    <p>Minimums vary by operator and redemption method. The comparison table uses the current source-linked operator records. Check cash and gift-card thresholds separately; an unverified amount does not mean there is no minimum.</p>
    <h3>What delays a sweepstakes casino redemption?</h3>
    <p>The common causes are incomplete identity verification, a name or address mismatch between your ID and your account, an incomplete wagering requirement on Sweeps Coins, and requests made over weekends or holidays when payment rails do not settle.</p>
    <h3>Has Social Casino Index tested these redemptions?</h3>
    <p>Not yet. The funded-testing dataset is in progress. This article currently compares official published terms only, and each operator is labeled pending until a funded test completes. We will not publish a ranking until at least three comparable tests have finished.</p>
